---
import '../../styles/admin-commerce.css';
---
<section id="view-commerce-dashboard" class="admin-section commerce-admin" style="display:none;" aria-labelledby="commerce-dashboard-title">
  <a class="commerce-back-link" href="/admin/commerce" data-view-target="commerce"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left" aria-hidden="true"></i> Commerce</a>
  <div class="commerce-command"><div><p class="commerce-kicker">Operación comercial</p><h2 id="commerce-dashboard-title">Dashboard de ventas</h2><p>Ingresos, ganancia bruta, pedidos e inventario calculados desde datos reales.</p></div><label class="commerce-period"><span>Periodo</span><select id="commerce-dashboard-period"><option value="today">Hoy</option><option value="7d">7 días</option><option value="30d" selected>30 días</option><option value="year">Este año</option></select></label></div>
  <div class="commerce-panel commerce-top-products"><div class="commerce-panel-head"><div><h3>Productos más vendidos</h3><p>Unidades confirmadas en el periodo; sin estimaciones.</p></div><div><span>Ticket promedio</span><strong id="market-average-ticket">—</strong></div></div><div class="market-recent-list" id="commerce-top-products"><p class="commerce-table-state">Cargando productos…</p></div></div>
  <div class="commerce-metrics commerce-metrics-six"><article><span>Ventas</span><strong id="market-sales">—</strong><small>Pagadas y completadas</small></article><article><span>Ganancia bruta</span><strong id="market-profit">—</strong><small>Según costo snapshot</small></article><article><span>Pedidos</span><strong id="market-orders">—</strong><small>En el periodo</small></article><article><span>Por verificar</span><strong id="market-review">—</strong><small>Pagos en revisión</small></article><article><span>Disponibles</span><strong id="market-available">—</strong><small>Publicaciones activas</small></article><article><span>Stock bajo</span><strong id="market-low">—</strong><small>Umbral configurado</small></article></div>
  <div class="commerce-panel"><div class="commerce-panel-head"><div><h3>Ingresos confirmados</h3><p>Serie diaria del periodo seleccionado.</p></div></div><div class="commerce-chart" id="commerce-chart" role="img" aria-label="Gráfica de ingresos"></div></div>
  <div class="commerce-panel"><div class="commerce-panel-head"><div><h3>Actividad reciente</h3><p>Últimos pedidos registrados.</p></div></div><div class="market-recent-list" id="commerce-recent-activity"><p class="commerce-table-state">Cargando actividad…</p></div></div>
</section>

<section id="view-commerce-orders" class="admin-section commerce-admin" style="display:none;" aria-labelledby="commerce-orders-title">
  <a class="commerce-back-link" href="/admin/commerce" data-view-target="commerce"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left" aria-hidden="true"></i> Commerce</a>
  <div class="commerce-command"><div><p class="commerce-kicker">Venta y seguimiento</p><h2 id="commerce-orders-title">Pedidos</h2><p>Revisa pagos, snapshots, timeline y cambia únicamente a estados válidos.</p></div><button class="commerce-button commerce-button-secondary" id="orders-refresh" type="button">Actualizar</button></div>
  <div class="commerce-metrics"><article><span>Pendientes</span><strong id="orders-pending">—</strong></article><article><span>Revisión</span><strong id="orders-review">—</strong></article><article><span>Pagados</span><strong id="orders-paid">—</strong></article><article><span>Preparando / listos</span><strong id="orders-ready">—</strong></article></div>
  <div class="commerce-panel"><form class="commerce-filters" id="orders-filters"><label class="commerce-search"><span>Buscar</span><input name="q" type="search" placeholder="Folio, cliente, correo o teléfono" /></label><label><span>Estado</span><select name="status"><option value="">Todos</option><option>PENDING_PAYMENT</option><option>PAYMENT_REVIEW</option><option>PAID</option><option>PREPARING</option><option>READY</option><option>COMPLETED</option><option>CANCELLED</option></select></label><label><span>Desde</span><input name="from" type="date" /></label><label><span>Hasta</span><input name="to" type="date" /></label><button class="commerce-button commerce-button-primary" type="submit">Aplicar</button></form><div class="commerce-table-wrap"><table class="commerce-table"><thead><tr><th>Folio</th><th>Cliente</th><th>Items</th><th>Total</th><th>Pago</th><th>Estado</th><th>Fecha</th></tr></thead><tbody id="orders-body"><tr><td colspan="7" class="commerce-table-state">Cargando pedidos…</td></tr></tbody></table></div><nav class="commerce-pagination" id="orders-pagination"><button id="orders-prev" type="button">Anterior</button><span id="orders-page">Página 1</span><button id="orders-next" type="button">Siguiente</button></nav></div>
</section>

<section id="view-commerce-payments" class="admin-section commerce-admin" style="display:none;" aria-labelledby="commerce-payments-title">
  <a class="commerce-back-link" href="/admin/commerce" data-view-target="commerce"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left" aria-hidden="true"></i> Commerce</a>
  <div class="commerce-command"><div><p class="commerce-kicker">Control de cobros</p><h2 id="commerce-payments-title">Pagos</h2><p>Abre el pedido para revisar el comprobante, aprobarlo o solicitar otro.</p></div></div>
  <div class="commerce-resource-tabs" id="payment-tabs"><button class="is-active" data-payment-status="" type="button">Todos</button><button data-payment-status="PENDING" type="button">Pendientes</button><button data-payment-status="UNDER_REVIEW" type="button">En revisión</button><button data-payment-status="APPROVED" type="button">Confirmados</button><button data-payment-status="REJECTED" type="button">Rechazados</button></div>
  <div class="commerce-panel"><div class="commerce-table-wrap"><table class="commerce-table"><thead><tr><th>Pedido</th><th>Cliente</th><th>Método</th><th>Monto</th><th>Estado</th><th>Revisó</th><th>Fecha revisión</th></tr></thead><tbody id="payments-body"><tr><td colspan="7" class="commerce-table-state">Cargando pagos…</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
</section>

<section id="view-commerce-inventory" class="admin-section commerce-admin" style="display:none;" aria-labelledby="commerce-inventory-title">
  <a class="commerce-back-link" href="/admin/commerce" data-view-target="commerce"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left" aria-hidden="true"></i> Commerce</a>
  <div class="commerce-command"><div><p class="commerce-kicker">Trazabilidad</p><h2 id="commerce-inventory-title">Inventario</h2><p>Cada reserva, venta, liberación, devolución y ajuste queda registrado.</p></div><button class="commerce-button commerce-button-primary" id="inventory-adjust-open" type="button">Nuevo ajuste</button></div>
  <div class="commerce-panel commerce-inventory-current"><div class="commerce-panel-head"><div><h3>Existencias actuales</h3><p>La disponibilidad se calcula como stock menos reservas activas.</p></div></div><div class="commerce-table-wrap"><table class="commerce-table"><thead><tr><th>SKU / producto</th><th>Categoría</th><th>Actual</th><th>Reservado</th><th>Disponible</th><th>Mínimo</th><th>Valor</th><th>Ubicación</th></tr></thead><tbody id="inventory-items-body"><tr><td colspan="8" class="commerce-table-state">Cargando existencias…</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
  <div class="commerce-metrics"><article><span>Stock</span><strong id="inventory-stock">—</strong></article><article><span>Valor</span><strong id="inventory-value">—</strong></article><article><span>Equipos disponibles</span><strong id="inventory-available">—</strong></article><article><span>Reservados</span><strong id="inventory-reserved">—</strong></article><article><span>Bajo stock</span><strong id="inventory-low">—</strong></article></div>
  <div class="commerce-resource-tabs" id="inventory-tabs"><button class="is-active" data-inventory-reason="" type="button">Todos</button><button data-inventory-reason="RESERVE" type="button">Reservas</button><button data-inventory-reason="SALE" type="button">Ventas</button><button data-inventory-reason="RELEASE" type="button">Liberaciones</button><button data-inventory-reason="ADJUSTMENT" type="button">Ajustes</button><button data-inventory-reason="RETURN" type="button">Devoluciones</button></div>
  <div class="commerce-panel"><div class="commerce-table-wrap"><table class="commerce-table"><thead><tr><th>Artículo</th><th>Anterior</th><th>Movimiento</th><th>Nuevo</th><th>Razón</th><th>Referencia</th><th>Usuario</th><th>Fecha</th></tr></thead><tbody id="inventory-body"><tr><td colspan="8" class="commerce-table-state">Cargando movimientos…</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
</section>

<section id="view-commerce-promotions" class="admin-section commerce-admin promotion-admin-page" style="display:none;" aria-labelledby="commerce-promotions-title">
  <a class="commerce-back-link" href="/admin/commerce" data-view-target="commerce"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left" aria-hidden="true"></i> Commerce</a>
  <div class="commerce-command promotion-command"><div><p class="commerce-kicker">Commerce → Crecimiento</p><h2 id="commerce-promotions-title">Promociones</h2><p>Diseña descuentos con alcance, vigencia y límites verificables antes de publicarlos.</p></div><button class="commerce-button commerce-button-primary" id="promotion-create" type="button"><i class="fa-solid fa-plus" aria-hidden="true"></i> Crear promoción</button></div>
  <div class="promotion-metrics" aria-label="Resumen de promociones">
    <article><span class="promotion-metric-icon is-active"><i class="fa-solid fa-bolt" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div><small>Activas</small><strong id="promotion-metric-active">—</strong><p>Aplicando ahora</p></div></article>
    <article><span class="promotion-metric-icon is-scheduled"><i class="fa-solid fa-clock" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div><small>Programadas</small><strong id="promotion-metric-scheduled">—</strong><p>Próximos lanzamientos</p></div></article>
    <article><span class="promotion-metric-icon is-usage"><i class="fa-solid fa-ticket" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div><small>Redenciones</small><strong id="promotion-metric-redemptions">—</strong><p>Usos confirmados</p></div></article>
    <article><span class="promotion-metric-icon is-savings"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-trend-down" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div><small>Descuento otorgado</small><strong id="promotion-metric-discount">—</strong><p>Pedidos confirmados</p></div></article>
  </div>
  <div class="promotion-workspace">
    <div class="promotion-toolbar">
      <div class="promotion-tabs" id="promotion-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Filtrar por estado">
        <button class="is-active" data-promotion-status="" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true">Todas <span id="promotion-count-all">0</span></button>
        <button data-promotion-status="ACTIVE" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Activas <span id="promotion-count-active">0</span></button>
        <button data-promotion-status="SCHEDULED" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Programadas <span id="promotion-count-scheduled">0</span></button>
        <button data-promotion-status="DRAFT" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Borradores <span id="promotion-count-draft">0</span></button>
        <button data-promotion-status="ENDED" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Finalizadas <span id="promotion-count-ended">0</span></button>
      </div>
      <form class="promotion-filters" id="promotion-filters" role="search">
        <label class="promotion-search"><span class="sr-only">Buscar promociones</span><i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass" aria-hidden="true"></i><input name="q" type="search" maxlength="120" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Nombre o código de cupón" /></label>
        <label><span class="sr-only">Tipo de descuento</span><select name="type"><option value="">Todos los descuentos</option><option value="PERCENT">Porcentaje</option><option value="FIXED">Monto fijo</option><option value="SALE_PRICE">Precio especial</option><option value="BUNDLE_PRICE">Precio de paquete</option></select></label>
        <label><span class="sr-only">Alcance</span><select name="scope"><option value="">Todos los alcances</option><option value="ITEM">Productos</option><option value="CATEGORY">Categorías</option><option value="BRAND">Marcas</option></select></label>
        <button class="commerce-icon-button" id="promotion-refresh" type="button" aria-label="Actualizar promociones" title="Actualizar"><i class="fa-solid fa-rotate" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
      </form>
    </div>
    <div class="commerce-table-wrap promotion-table-wrap">
      <table class="commerce-table promotion-table"><thead><tr><th>Promoción</th><th>Beneficio</th><th>Se aplica a</th><th>Condiciones</th><th>Rendimiento</th><th>Vigencia</th><th>Estado</th><th><span class="sr-only">Acciones</span></th></tr></thead><tbody id="promotions-body"><tr><td colspan="8" class="commerce-table-state">Cargando promociones…</td></tr></tbody></table>
    </div>
    <div class="promotion-mobile-list" id="promotion-mobile-list" aria-live="polite"></div>
    <div class="promotion-empty" id="promotion-empty" hidden><span><i class="fa-solid fa-tags" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><h3>Aún no hay promociones</h3><p>Crea la primera regla y revisa su impacto antes de mostrarla en la tienda.</p><button class="commerce-button commerce-button-primary" id="promotion-empty-create" type="button">Crear primera promoción</button></div>
    <nav class="commerce-pagination promotion-pagination" id="promotion-pagination" aria-label="Paginación de promociones" hidden><button id="promotion-prev" type="button">Anterior</button><span id="promotion-page">Página 1</span><button id="promotion-next" type="button">Siguiente</button></nav>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="view-commerce-settings" class="admin-section commerce-admin payment-settings-page" style="display:none;" aria-labelledby="commerce-settings-payment-title">
  <a class="commerce-back-link" href="/admin/commerce" data-view-target="commerce"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left" aria-hidden="true"></i> Commerce</a>
  <div class="commerce-command payment-settings-command">
    <div>
      <p class="commerce-kicker">Configuración → Cobros</p>
      <h2 id="commerce-settings-payment-title">Métodos de pago</h2>
      <p>Controla qué opciones puede elegir el cliente y verifica si cada canal está listo para operar.</p>
    </div>
    <button class="commerce-button commerce-button-secondary" id="payment-settings-refresh" type="button"><i class="fa-solid fa-rotate" aria-hidden="true"></i> Actualizar diagnóstico</button>
  </div>

  <div class="payment-health-grid" aria-label="Resumen de métodos de pago">
    <article><span class="payment-health-icon is-success"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div><small>Métodos activos</small><strong id="payment-active-count">—</strong><p>Visibles en checkout</p></div></article>
    <article><span class="payment-health-icon is-info"><i class="fa-solid fa-store" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div><small>Pago al recoger</small><strong id="payment-onsite-count">—</strong><p>Efectivo y terminal</p></div></article>
    <article><span class="payment-health-icon is-online"><i class="fa-solid fa-credit-card" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div><small>Cobro online</small><strong id="payment-online-status">—</strong><p>Proveedores operativos</p></div></article>
    <article><span class="payment-health-icon is-warning"><i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div><small>Atención requerida</small><strong id="payment-warning-count">—</strong><p>Configuraciones pendientes</p></div></article>
  </div>

  <div class="payment-readiness-banner" id="payment-readiness-banner" role="status" aria-live="polite">
    <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved" aria-hidden="true"></i>
    <div><strong>Comprobando seguridad de cobro…</strong><p>Solo se publicarán métodos activos y técnicamente operativos.</p></div>
  </div>

  <form class="payment-settings-form" id="payment-settings-form" novalidate>
    <div class="payment-settings-main">
      <fieldset class="payment-method-section" data-method-section="BANK_TRANSFER">
        <legend class="sr-only">Transferencia bancaria</legend>
        <header class="payment-method-head">
          <span class="payment-method-brand is-transfer"><i class="fa-solid fa-building-columns" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
          <div><h3>Transferencia bancaria</h3><p>El cliente recibe los datos y sube su comprobante para revisión.</p></div>
          <label class="payment-toggle"><span class="sr-only">Activar transferencia bancaria</span><input name="BANK_TRANSFER.enabled" type="checkbox" role="switch" /><span aria-hidden="true"></span></label>
        </header>
        <div class="payment-method-body" data-method-panel="BANK_TRANSFER">
          <div class="payment-field-grid">
            <label><span>Beneficiario <b aria-hidden="true">*</b></span><input name="BANK_TRANSFER.beneficiary" maxlength="160" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Nombre o razón social" /></label>
            <label><span>Banco <b aria-hidden="true">*</b></span><input name="BANK_TRANSFER.bank" maxlength="120" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Ej. BBVA" /></label>
            <label><span>CLABE interbancaria</span><input name="BANK_TRANSFER.clabe" maxlength="18" minlength="18" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]{18}" autocomplete="off" placeholder="18 dígitos" aria-describedby="payment-clabe-help" /><small id="payment-clabe-help">Recomendada para transferencias SPEI.</small></label>
            <label><span>Número de cuenta</span><input name="BANK_TRANSFER.account" maxlength="20" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]{4,20}" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Solo números" /><small>Opcional si ya registraste una CLABE.</small></label>
            <label class="commerce-span-2"><span>Instrucciones para el cliente</span><textarea name="BANK_TRANSFER.instructions" rows="3" maxlength="1000" placeholder="Ej. Usa el folio del pedido como concepto y conserva tu comprobante."></textarea><small>No solicites contraseñas, NIP, CVV ni fotografías de tarjetas.</small></label>
          </div>
        </div>
      </fieldset>

      <section class="payment-method-section" aria-labelledby="payment-onsite-title">
        <header class="payment-section-title"><div><p class="commerce-kicker">Cobro presencial</p><h3 id="payment-onsite-title">Pago al recoger</h3><p>Opciones confirmadas por el personal cuando el cliente acude al negocio.</p></div><span class="payment-status-pill is-ready">Disponible hoy</span></header>
        <div class="payment-onsite-grid">
          <article class="payment-compact-card" data-method-section="CASH">
            <header><span class="payment-method-brand is-cash"><i class="fa-solid fa-money-bill-wave" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div><h4>Efectivo</h4><p>Pago en sucursal</p></div><label class="payment-toggle"><span class="sr-only">Activar efectivo</span><input name="CASH.enabled" type="checkbox" role="switch" /><span aria-hidden="true"></span></label></header>
            <label><span>Mensaje para el cliente</span><textarea name="CASH.instructions" rows="2" maxlength="1000"></textarea></label>
          </article>
          <article class="payment-compact-card" data-method-section="TERMINAL">
            <header><span class="payment-method-brand is-terminal"><i class="fa-solid fa-credit-card" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div><h4>Terminal</h4><p>Tarjeta en sucursal</p></div><label class="payment-toggle"><span class="sr-only">Activar terminal</span><input name="TERMINAL.enabled" type="checkbox" role="switch" /><span aria-hidden="true"></span></label></header>
            <label><span>Mensaje para el cliente</span><textarea name="TERMINAL.instructions" rows="2" maxlength="1000"></textarea></label>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="payment-method-section" aria-labelledby="payment-online-title">
        <header class="payment-section-title"><div><p class="commerce-kicker">Cobro con tarjeta en línea</p><h3 id="payment-online-title">Proveedores de pago</h3><p>Una opción online solo puede activarse cuando creación de pago, webhook y conciliación estén completos.</p></div><span class="payment-status-pill is-blocked" id="payment-online-pill">No operativo</span></header>
        <div class="payment-security-note"><i class="fa-solid fa-lock" aria-hidden="true"></i><p>Las llaves privadas se administran únicamente en el servidor. Pixon nunca debe capturar ni almacenar números de tarjeta, CVV o NIP.</p></div>
        <div class="payment-provider-grid">
          <article class="payment-provider-card" data-provider-card="STRIPE">
            <header><span class="payment-provider-logo">S</span><div><h4>Stripe</h4><p>Tarjetas y wallets</p></div><span class="payment-status-pill" data-provider-status="STRIPE">Comprobando…</span></header>
            <ul class="payment-readiness-list"><li data-provider-check="credentials"><i></i>Credenciales y webhook</li><li data-provider-check="checkout"><i></i>Sesión de pago</li><li data-provider-check="reconciliation"><i></i>Conciliación automática</li></ul>
            <label class="payment-provider-enable"><span><strong>Mostrar en checkout</strong><small>Se desbloquea al completar la integración</small></span><span class="payment-toggle"><input name="STRIPE.enabled" type="checkbox" role="switch" aria-label="Activar Stripe" /><span aria-hidden="true"></span></span></label>
            <label class="payment-provider-message"><span>Mensaje para el cliente</span><textarea name="STRIPE.instructions" rows="2" maxlength="1000"></textarea></label>
          </article>
          <article class="payment-provider-card" data-provider-card="PAYPAL">
            <header><span class="payment-provider-logo is-paypal">P</span><div><h4>PayPal</h4><p>Cuenta y tarjeta</p></div><span class="payment-status-pill" data-provider-status="PAYPAL">Comprobando…</span></header>
            <ul class="payment-readiness-list"><li data-provider-check="credentials"><i></i>Credenciales y webhook</li><li data-provider-check="checkout"><i></i>Sesión de pago</li><li data-provider-check="reconciliation"><i></i>Conciliación automática</li></ul>
            <label class="payment-provider-enable"><span><strong>Mostrar en checkout</strong><small>Se desbloquea al completar la integración</small></span><span class="payment-toggle"><input name="PAYPAL.enabled" type="checkbox" role="switch" aria-label="Activar PayPal" /><span aria-hidden="true"></span></span></label>
            <label class="payment-provider-message"><span>Mensaje para el cliente</span><textarea name="PAYPAL.instructions" rows="2" maxlength="1000"></textarea></label>
          </article>
          <article class="payment-provider-card" data-provider-card="MERCADO_PAGO">
            <header><span class="payment-provider-logo is-mercado">M</span><div><h4>Mercado Pago</h4><p>Tarjetas y saldo</p></div><span class="payment-status-pill" data-provider-status="MERCADO_PAGO">Comprobando…</span></header>
            <ul class="payment-readiness-list"><li data-provider-check="credentials"><i></i>Credenciales y webhook</li><li data-provider-check="checkout"><i></i>Sesión de pago</li><li data-provider-check="reconciliation"><i></i>Conciliación automática</li></ul>
            <label class="payment-provider-enable"><span><strong>Mostrar en checkout</strong><small>Se desbloquea al completar la integración</small></span><span class="payment-toggle"><input name="MERCADO_PAGO.enabled" type="checkbox" role="switch" aria-label="Activar Mercado Pago" /><span aria-hidden="true"></span></span></label>
            <label class="payment-provider-message"><span>Mensaje para el cliente</span><textarea name="MERCADO_PAGO.instructions" rows="2" maxlength="1000"></textarea></label>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>

    <aside class="payment-settings-preview" aria-labelledby="payment-preview-title">
      <div class="payment-preview-sticky">
        <header><span><i class="fa-solid fa-eye" aria-hidden="true"></i> Vista del cliente</span><small>Checkout</small></header>
        <div class="payment-preview-window">
          <p class="payment-preview-eyebrow">Forma de pago</p>
          <h3 id="payment-preview-title">¿Cómo deseas pagar?</h3>
          <p>Estas son las opciones que aparecerán al terminar la compra.</p>
          <div id="payment-settings-preview" class="payment-preview-methods" aria-live="polite"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="payment-preview-note"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info" aria-hidden="true"></i><p>La vista previa no realiza cargos. Refleja disponibilidad e instrucciones públicas.</p></div>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <div class="payment-save-bar" role="group" aria-label="Guardar configuración de pagos">
      <div><span class="payment-save-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><p><strong id="payment-save-state">Sin cambios pendientes</strong><small id="payment-last-updated">Configuración cargada</small></p></div>
      <div class="payment-save-actions"><button class="commerce-button commerce-button-secondary" id="payment-settings-reset" type="button" disabled>Descartar cambios</button><button class="commerce-button commerce-button-primary" id="payment-settings-submit" type="submit" disabled><i class="fa-solid fa-floppy-disk" aria-hidden="true"></i> Guardar cambios</button></div>
      <div class="commerce-form-message" id="payment-settings-message" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></div>
    </div>
  </form>
</section>

<div class="commerce-modal" id="order-detail-modal" hidden><div class="commerce-modal-backdrop" data-market-close="order"></div><section class="commerce-modal-card commerce-modal-card-wide" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="order-detail-title"><header class="commerce-modal-head"><div><p class="commerce-kicker">Pedido</p><h2 id="order-detail-title">Detalle</h2></div><button class="commerce-icon-button" type="button" data-market-close="order" aria-label="Cerrar">×</button></header><div id="order-detail-content"></div></section></div>

<div class="commerce-modal" id="inventory-adjust-modal" hidden><div class="commerce-modal-backdrop" data-market-close="adjust"></div><section class="commerce-modal-card" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="inventory-adjust-title"><header class="commerce-modal-head"><h2 id="inventory-adjust-title">Ajustar inventario</h2><button class="commerce-icon-button" type="button" data-market-close="adjust">×</button></header><form id="inventory-adjust-form" class="commerce-form-grid"><label><span>ID de artículo</span><input name="catalog_item_id" type="number" min="1" required /></label><label><span>Delta</span><input name="delta" type="number" required /></label><label class="commerce-span-2"><span>Motivo obligatorio</span><textarea name="reason" maxlength="500" required></textarea></label><button class="commerce-button commerce-button-primary" type="submit">Registrar ajuste</button></form></section></div>

<div class="commerce-modal promotion-modal" id="promotion-modal" hidden>
  <div class="commerce-modal-backdrop" data-market-close="promotion"></div>
  <section class="commerce-modal-card promotion-builder-modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="promotion-modal-title">
    <header class="commerce-modal-head promotion-modal-head"><div><p class="commerce-kicker" id="promotion-modal-mode">Nueva regla comercial</p><h2 id="promotion-modal-title">Crear promoción</h2></div><div><span class="promotion-status-pill is-draft" id="promotion-editor-status">Borrador</span><button class="commerce-icon-button" type="button" data-market-close="promotion" aria-label="Cerrar"><i class="fa-solid fa-xmark" aria-hidden="true"></i></button></div></header>
    <form id="promotion-form" novalidate>
      <input name="id" type="hidden" />
      <div class="promotion-builder-layout">
        <div class="promotion-builder-main">
          <section class="promotion-form-card" aria-labelledby="promotion-identity-title">
            <header><span>1</span><div><h3 id="promotion-identity-title">Identidad y publicación</h3><p>Nombre interno, cupón y estado de la regla.</p></div></header>
            <div class="promotion-form-grid">
              <label class="promotion-span-2"><span>Nombre interno <b>*</b></span><input name="name" maxlength="160" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Ej. Regreso a clases · Laptops 10%" required /></label>
              <label><span>Código de cupón</span><input name="coupon_code" maxlength="64" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Opcional, ej. PIXON10" /><small>Si queda vacío, el descuento es automático.</small></label>
              <label><span>Estado de publicación</span><select name="status"><option value="DRAFT">Guardar como borrador</option><option value="ACTIVE">Publicar / programar</option><option value="ENDED" hidden>Finalizada</option></select><small>Una fecha futura la convierte en programada.</small></label>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="promotion-form-card" aria-labelledby="promotion-benefit-title">
            <header><span>2</span><div><h3 id="promotion-benefit-title">Beneficio</h3><p>Define qué cambia en el precio.</p></div></header>
            <fieldset class="promotion-type-picker"><legend class="sr-only">Tipo de descuento</legend>
              <label><input type="radio" name="promotion_type" value="PERCENT" checked /><span><i class="fa-solid fa-percent" aria-hidden="true"></i><strong>Porcentaje</strong><small>Reduce un porcentaje</small></span></label>
              <label><input type="radio" name="promotion_type" value="FIXED" /><span><i class="fa-solid fa-minus" aria-hidden="true"></i><strong>Monto fijo</strong><small>Resta una cantidad</small></span></label>
              <label><input type="radio" name="promotion_type" value="SALE_PRICE" /><span><i class="fa-solid fa-tag" aria-hidden="true"></i><strong>Precio especial</strong><small>Fija el precio final</small></span></label>
              <label><input type="radio" name="promotion_type" value="BUNDLE_PRICE" /><span><i class="fa-solid fa-boxes-stacked" aria-hidden="true"></i><strong>Precio paquete</strong><small>Precio final de bundle</small></span></label>
            </fieldset>
            <div class="promotion-value-row"><label><span id="promotion-value-label">Porcentaje de descuento <b>*</b></span><span class="promotion-value-input"><b id="promotion-value-prefix" hidden>$</b><input name="promotion_value" type="number" min="0.01" max="100" step="0.01" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="10" required /><b id="promotion-value-suffix">%</b></span></label><div><span>Ejemplo</span><strong id="promotion-value-example">$1,000 → $900</strong><small id="promotion-value-help">El porcentaje máximo permitido es 100%.</small></div></div>
          </section>

          <section class="promotion-form-card" aria-labelledby="promotion-target-title">
            <header><span>3</span><div><h3 id="promotion-target-title">¿A qué se aplica?</h3><p>Selecciona objetivos reales; no es necesario conocer IDs.</p></div><strong id="promotion-target-count">0 seleccionados</strong></header>
            <fieldset class="promotion-scope-picker"><legend class="sr-only">Alcance de la promoción</legend>
              <label><input type="radio" name="scope" value="ITEM" checked /><span><i class="fa-solid fa-box" aria-hidden="true"></i> Productos</span></label>
              <label><input type="radio" name="scope" value="CATEGORY" /><span><i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group" aria-hidden="true"></i> Categorías</span></label>
              <label><input type="radio" name="scope" value="BRAND" /><span><i class="fa-solid fa-certificate" aria-hidden="true"></i> Marcas</span></label>
            </fieldset>
            <label class="promotion-target-search"><span class="sr-only">Buscar objetivos</span><i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass" aria-hidden="true"></i><input id="promotion-target-search" type="search" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Buscar producto, SKU o marca" /></label>
            <div class="promotion-target-list" id="promotion-target-list" role="group" aria-label="Objetivos disponibles"><p class="commerce-table-state">Cargando catálogo…</p></div>
            <p class="promotion-field-error" id="promotion-target-error" hidden>Selecciona al menos un objetivo.</p>
          </section>

          <details class="promotion-form-card promotion-advanced">
            <summary><span><i class="fa-solid fa-sliders" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div><strong>Condiciones, límites y prioridad</strong><small>Opcional · controla cuándo aplica y cómo se combina.</small></div><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down" aria-hidden="true"></i></summary>
            <div class="promotion-form-grid">
              <label><span>Cantidad mínima</span><input name="minimum_quantity" type="number" min="1" max="100" value="1" /></label>
              <label><span>Compra mínima</span><input name="minimum_subtotal" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" value="0.00" /></label>
              <label><span>Usos totales máximos</span><input name="max_redemptions" type="number" min="1" placeholder="Sin límite" /></label>
              <label><span>Usos máximos por cliente</span><input name="max_redemptions_per_customer" type="number" min="1" placeholder="Sin límite" /></label>
              <label><span>Prioridad</span><input name="priority" type="number" min="-32768" max="32767" value="0" /><small>Un número mayor se evalúa primero.</small></label>
              <div class="promotion-rule-switches"><label><input name="stackable" type="checkbox" /><span><strong>Permitir acumulación</strong><small>Puede combinarse con otras reglas compatibles.</small></span></label><label><input name="stop_processing" type="checkbox" checked /><span><strong>Detener reglas posteriores</strong><small>No evaluar promociones con menor prioridad.</small></span></label></div>
            </div>
          </details>

          <section class="promotion-form-card" aria-labelledby="promotion-schedule-title">
            <header><span>4</span><div><h3 id="promotion-schedule-title">Vigencia</h3><p>Las fechas se capturan en horario de Cancún y se guardan de forma normalizada.</p></div></header>
            <div class="promotion-form-grid"><label><span>Inicia</span><input name="starts_at" type="datetime-local" /><small>Vacío: inicia al publicar.</small></label><label><span>Finaliza</span><input name="ends_at" type="datetime-local" /><small>Vacío: no tiene vencimiento.</small></label></div>
          </section>

          <section class="promotion-form-card" aria-labelledby="promotion-presentation-title">
            <header><span>5</span><div><h3 id="promotion-presentation-title">Presentación al cliente</h3><p>Contenido visible en tienda y materiales promocionales.</p></div></header>
            <div class="promotion-form-grid"><label><span>Título público</span><input name="presentation_title" maxlength="180" placeholder="Oferta especial por tiempo limitado" /></label><label><span>Insignia</span><select name="badge_id" id="promotion-badge"><option value="">Sin insignia</option></select></label><label class="promotion-span-2"><span>Descripción pública</span><textarea name="presentation_text" rows="3" maxlength="500" placeholder="Explica el beneficio y sus condiciones principales."></textarea></label><label class="promotion-span-2"><span>Imagen o banner opcional</span><input name="presentation_banner" maxlength="512" placeholder="/assets/images/promociones/banner.webp" /></label></div>
          </section>
        </div>

        <aside class="promotion-preview-panel" aria-labelledby="promotion-preview-heading">
          <div class="promotion-preview-sticky">
            <header><span><i class="fa-solid fa-eye" aria-hidden="true"></i> Resumen antes de publicar</span><small id="promotion-preview-state">Borrador</small></header>
            <div class="promotion-preview-card"><span class="promotion-preview-badge" id="promotion-preview-badge">Promoción</span><h3 id="promotion-preview-heading">Nueva promoción</h3><strong id="promotion-preview-value">10% menos</strong><p id="promotion-preview-description">Agrega un título y una descripción para el cliente.</p><dl><div><dt>Alcance</dt><dd id="promotion-preview-target">Sin objetivos</dd></div><div><dt>Vigencia</dt><dd id="promotion-preview-dates">Sin límite</dd></div><div><dt>Condición</dt><dd id="promotion-preview-condition">Sin mínimo</dd></div><div><dt>Cupón</dt><dd id="promotion-preview-coupon">Automática</dd></div></dl></div>
            <div class="promotion-impact" id="promotion-impact"><header><div><strong>Impacto estimado</strong><small>Calculado por el servidor</small></div><button id="promotion-impact-refresh" type="button" aria-label="Recalcular impacto"><i class="fa-solid fa-rotate" aria-hidden="true"></i></button></header><div class="promotion-impact-metrics"><div><span>Productos</span><strong id="promotion-impact-products">—</strong></div><div><span>Con descuento</span><strong id="promotion-impact-discounted">—</strong></div><div><span>Bajo costo</span><strong id="promotion-impact-risk">—</strong></div></div><div id="promotion-impact-message" class="promotion-impact-message">Completa valor y objetivos para calcular.</div><div class="promotion-impact-sample" id="promotion-impact-sample"></div></div>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
      <div class="commerce-form-message promotion-form-message" id="promotion-form-message" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></div>
      <div class="promotion-modal-actions" role="group" aria-label="Acciones de la promoción"><button class="commerce-button promotion-end-button" id="promotion-delete" type="button" hidden><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-stop" aria-hidden="true"></i> Finalizar promoción</button><span></span><button class="commerce-button commerce-button-secondary" type="button" data-market-close="promotion">Cancelar</button><button class="commerce-button commerce-button-primary" id="promotion-submit" type="submit"><i class="fa-solid fa-floppy-disk" aria-hidden="true"></i> Guardar promoción</button></div>
    </form>
  </section>
</div>

